  <section class="section container">
    <h2>7. Cost composition: the hidden charges that separate headline rate from landed cost</h2>
    <p>
      Most comparisons break on destination charges. Sea adds OTHC/DTHC, CFS, bunker and
      documentation; air adds fuel, security, terminal handling and clearance. The snapshot does not
      publish dollar amounts for most of these, so they are LOW confidence and must be requested as
      itemised quotes. The one quantified item is <strong>demurrage and detention: $75–$300 per day
      after 3–7 free days</strong>.
    </p>
    <DataTable
      columns={[
        { key: 'item', label: 'Cost item' },
        { key: 'mode', label: 'Mode' },
        { key: 'who', label: 'Charged by' },
